13945,0,"If you want to import configuration on every start of Open Salamander, export it to installation directory to file named config.reg. To import other configuration file use command line parameter -C (e.g. "salamand.exe -C myconfig.reg").\n\nWe recommend to add clearing of registry key with configuration directly to exported file. Otherwise imported configuration will be merged with the current one in registry and it may result in inconsistent configuration."
13946,0,"If you want to import configuration on every start of Open Salamander, export it to application data directory (or installation directory) to file named config.reg. To import other configuration file use command line parameter -C (e.g. "salamand.exe -C myconfig.reg").\n\nWe recommend to add clearing of registry key with configuration directly to exported file. Otherwise imported configuration will be merged with the current one in registry and it may result in inconsistent configuration."
